  "next_id": 39,
  "notes": [
    {
      "at": [
        -70,
        -48
      ],
      "id": 38,
      "text": "Timed one-wire protocols (SN-225) bit-banged by the Blue Pill with the DWT cycle counter: a DS18B20 on PB5 and a DHT22 on PB4\n(open drain, 4.7 kOhm pull-ups), an HC-SR04 on PB3/PB6 and a strip of 8 WS2812B LEDs on PA8. Open the UART terminal: one line\nper second. The strip shows the distance, 25 cm per LED. Change the distance, temperature or humidity in Properties while running;\nthe Logic tab shows the pulses of DQ, DHT and ECHO."
    }
  ],
